  "aiContextParagraph": "The East Nusa Tenggara (NTT) police force has advanced its investigation into allegations of sexual assault leveled against Kupang Regent Yosef Lede. Authorities confirmed they have obtained forensic examination results related to the case involving a student victim. Law enforcement officials have pledged that the investigation will proceed without external interference to ensure transparency and accountability. Meanwhile, the Governor of NTT has publicly voiced support for the police's handling of the matter. The investigation has drawn significant political attention, with calls for the Ministry of Home Affairs to monitor the situation. Additionally, representatives from the Witness and Victim Protection Agency are currently monitoring the condition of the accuser. Public protests have occurred in the region, with students reportedly sealing the residence of the official as legal inquiries continue to unfold under the oversight of the provincial police.",
